-- KAZA STATEMENT SQL ------------------------------------ main.franco.kl  K1604

El SQL literal da feeh aktar men statement (`;` bara el quotes). W kol qeema `Sql` statement wa7ed bel zabt.

3│     khali q = sql"DELETE FROM users WHERE name = {name}; DELETE FROM notes"
                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

Mosa3da: Qassemha l `sql"..."` l kol statement, w shaghalhom gowa transaction law lazem yenga7o ma3 ba3d.

